            <ArticleTitle>[Effect of dalargin on the course of myocardial ischemia].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>13-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>In cat experiments, the effects of dalargin were examined on blood pressure in the animals with its various baseline levels and on the development of ischemic arrhythmias. Dalargin was demonstrated to produce a modulating effect on blood pressure and to reduce the incidence of ventricular fibrillation in myocardial ischemia.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
